Incident 1 :
While starting the WORKER container hitting this issue.
urllib3.exceptions.MaxRetryError: HTTPSConnectionPool(host='httpbin.org', port=443): Max retries exceeded with url: /post (Caused by NameResolutionError("HTTPSConnection(host='httpbin.org', port=443): Failed to resolve 'httpbin.org' ([Errno -3] Temporary failure in name resolution)"))

Root cause : there is a environment variable which has the value of a webhook to which the WORKER will push the reports. Since the WORKER is in internal network it can not acceesss the internet and failing to resolve the webhoot hostname.

Workaround : Provide enpty value for the webhook variable.

